ata-id=\"d75dbac\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"divider.default\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-divider\">\n\t\t\t<span class=\"elementor-divider-separator\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<span class=\"elementor-divider__text elementor-divider__element\">\n\t\t\t\tVISI\t\t\t\t<\/span>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/span>\n\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-column elementor-col-50 elementor-top-column elementor-element elementor-element-d26479e\" data-id=\"d26479e\" data-element_type=\"column\">\n\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-wrap elementor-element-populated\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-af1d5fa elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor\" data-id=\"af1d5fa\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"text-editor.default\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<p>Mewujudkan sebuah perusahaan properti digital sebagai etalase panutan dengan menerapkan kaidah ramah lingkungan dan dapat memberdayakan masyarakat.<\/p>\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t<\/section>\n\t\t\t\t<section class=\"elementor-section elementor-top-section elementor-element elementor-element-9877c11 elementor-hidden-desktop elementor-hidden-tablet elementor-hidden-mobile elementor-section-boxed elementor-section-height-default elementor-section-height-default astroon-bg-container\" data-id=\"9877c11\" data-element_type=\"section\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-container elementor-column-gap-no\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-column elementor-col-50 elementor-top-column elementor-element elementor-element-6fc0a37\" data-id=\"6fc0a37\" data-element_type=\"column\">\n\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-wrap elementor-element-populated\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-091655f elementor-widget-divider--view-line_text elementor-widget-divider--element-align-left elementor-widget elementor-widget-divider\" data-id=\"091655f\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"divider.default\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-divider\">\n\t\t\t<span class=\"elementor-divider-separator\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<span class=\"elementor-divider__text elementor-divider__element\">\n\t\t\t\tMISI\t\t\t\t<\/span>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/span>\n\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-column elementor-col-50 elementor-top-column elementor-element elementor-element-7df8b03\" data-id=\"7df8b03\" data-element_type=\"column\">\n\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-wrap elementor-element-populated\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-d7adb8d elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor\" data-id=\"d7adb8d\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"text-editor.default\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<p>\u00a0<\/p><ul><li>Memberikan pengalaman properti digital yang berkelanjutan untuk memberikan layanan terbaik di kelasnya kepada pelanggan.<\/li><li>Menerapkan standar terbaik di dalam aktivitas usaha yang cerdas pada manajemen tim yang lincah &amp; ramping.<\/li><li>Membina talenta digital di industri properti guna membantu mengembangkan kemampuan digital grup dan meningkatkan adopsi digital bangsa<\/li><\/ul>\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t<\/section>\n\t\t\t\t<section class=\"elementor-section elementor-top-section elementor-element elementor-element-6a01e12 elementor-section-content-middle elementor-section-boxed elementor-section-height-default elementor-section-height-default astroon-bg-container\" data-id=\"6a01e12\" data-element_type=\"section\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-container elementor-column-gap-default\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-column elementor-col-50 elementor-top-column elementor-element elementor-element-d833a05\" data-id=\"d833a05\" data-element_type=\"column\" data-settings=\"{&quot;background_background&quot;:&quot;classic&quot;}\">\n\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-wrap elementor-element-populated\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-c5461de elementor-widget elementor-widget-heading\" data-id=\"c5461de\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"heading.default\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n\t\t\t<h2 class=\"elementor-heading-title elementor-size-default\">About Us<\/h2>\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-862de49 elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor\" data-id=\"862de49\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"text-editor.default\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<span>Telkom Landmark Tower adalah gedung perkantoran yang beralamat di Jalan Gatot Subroto, Jakarta Selatan. Telkom Landmark Tower\u00a0merupakan proyek Telkom Landmark oleh Grup Telkom dan sudah mendapatkan pengakuan Desain Platinum dari Green Building Council Indonesia pada tahun 2015. Telkom Landmark Tower memiliki fasilitas vertical garden, food court, auditorium, dan mushola. Tersedia akses alternatif ke kawasan SCBD Sudirman juga berarti bahwa Telkom Landmark Tower dapat memanfaatkan fasilitas di mall Pacific Place Jakarta dan bangunan komersial dan pemukiman lainnya di kawasan SCBD Sudirman.<span>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-27efd9d elementor-widget__width-initial elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor\" data-id=\"27efd9d\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"text-editor.default\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<span>Telkom Landmark Tower\u00a0terletak pada kawasan segitiga emas Jakarta sehingga memiliki akses mudah ke jalan tol dan bandara terdekat dan dilayani oleh beberapa jaringan transportasi umum termasuk jaringan busway TransJakarta, bus, dan taksi. Stasiun MRT Jakarta terdekat (Istora Mandiri dan Bendungan Hilir) terletak tidak jauh dari Jalan Sudirman. Telkom Landmark Tower berlokasi di antara Jalan Sudirman (ke barat) dan Jalan Rasuna Said (ke timur) dan kawasan Mega Kuningan terletak tidak jauh dari sisi utara Jalan Gatot Subroto, Jakarta Selatan.\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-column elementor-col-50 elementor-top-column elementor-element elementor-element-8052dbf elementor-hidden-mobile\" data-id=\"8052dbf\" data-element_type=\"column\" data-settings=\"{&quot;background_background&quot;:&quot;classic&quot;}\">\n\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-wrap elementor-element-populated\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-background-overlay\"><\/div>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-e41a8aa elementor-widget__width-initial elementor-absolute elementor-widget elementor-widget-image\" data-id=\"e41a8aa\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-settings=\"{&quot;_position&quot;:&quot;absolute&quot;}\" data-widget_type=\"image.default\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<img decoding=\"async\" width=\"429\" height=\"825\" src=\"https:\/\/kamadigdev.site\/wp-content\/uploads\/2024\/02\/TLT.png\" class=\"attachment-large size-large wp-image-7037\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" srcset=\"https:\/\/kamadigdev.site\/wp-content\/uploads\/2024\/02\/TLT.png 429w, https:\/\/kamadigdev.site\/wp-content\/uploads\/2024\/02\/TLT-156x300.png 156w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 429px) 100vw, 429px\" \/>\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t<\/section>\n\t\t\t\t<section class=\"elementor-section elementor-top-section elementor-element elementor-element-6167b32 eleme